 receive an automated email reminder 7 days before the party. We will also check-in with you via text the day before to confirm all final details.\n\nPlease email or text us at 619-618-0745 if you have questions regarding your event. \n\n-----\nPlease remember the following:\n\n⏰  We will arrive 15-30 mins prior to the start time to get set up\n\n🚐 Please save a parking spot for us \n\n🐾 We will bring animals from either your top or alternate choices. While we aim for your top choices, your top choices may not always be available. Thank you for understanding. \n\n🎈🔈Please no balloons/streamers/loud music in the animal area\n\n⛱  Please provide a location with full shade (canopy preferred) away from bodies of water, food, your personal pets/other animals, and where guests cannot walk behind our set up 🚧 \n\n☔️ We operate rain or shine. In the event of rain, please provide fully covered or indoor location\n\n🔥 In the event of high temps (>85°F) we appreciate an indoor, air conditioned location or access to power so we can bring our own fans for cooling (some zoo animals are sensitive to heat).\n\n👀 We expect ALL children will be supervised by a parent or adult during the program\n\n🍕 To keep guests and the animals safe, we ask that there is no eating/snacks during the animal program. \n\n🥾 Are there any stairs or other possible challenges for getting to the set up location? Let us know now by replying to this email \n\nThank you!!", "cancellation_notes": "There are no refunds. We operate rain or shine.\n\nCanceling 31+ days prior will receive a refund of 75% of the paid value. \nCanceling within 30 days of your scheduled event will result in no refund. \nThe FareHarbor booking fee is not refundable.\nReschedule requests are required 30 days in advance. \nDonations are not refundable or tax deductible. \nWe reserve the right to reschedule/refund if we need to cancel a program.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "1 Hour • 16 - 